* Eggs hatch wherever they lie (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own script;
* owner, 2026-11-11). script-patches.txt keeps a dropped egg's timer
* running; this starts again the timers of norn eggs dropped before that
* (their timers were stopped). Every norn egg that has not hatched gets its
* timer set again at every load (a running timer only loses part of one
* step; CARR cannot be asked here, as it reads the script's owner). Eggs in
* water still wait for dry land, as in C2.
* any world: it changes objects by kind, not Eden's map, so it runs on every
* world (other Additions run only on worlds started from Eden.sfc).
